{
  "info": {
    "name": "aBILLity API test",
    "description": "Tests the aBILLity half of the company name sync on its own - credentials, company id, and the rename the Worker performs - with no Autotask or Cloudflare involved.\n\nSETUP\n  Variables tab: systemInformation, abillityUserName, abillityPassword, companyId, and testName.\n\nORDER\n  1 reads the company and stores its current name. Safe, changes nothing.\n  2 renames it. THIS WRITES TO LIVE BILLING DATA.\n  3 puts the original name back.\n\nRun 1 before 2, and 3 straight after, on a company you are willing to rename. If you only want to check the credentials, run 1 and stop.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Get company (read-only)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "SystemInformation",
            "value": "{{systemInformation}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "username",
            "value": "{{abillityUserName}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "password",
            "value": "{{abillityPassword}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.abillity.co.uk/api/company/{{companyId}}"
        },
        "description": "Looks the company up and stores its current name in {{originalName}}, so request 3 can put it back.\n\nChanges nothing. Always run this first.\n\n404 means no company with that id - which is exactly what the Worker would hit if the 'aBillity Company ID' UDF is wrong."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const code = pm.response.code;",
              "",
              "if (code === 401) { console.log('401 - aBILLity rejected the credentials.'); }",
              "if (code === 403) { console.log('403 - credentials valid, but not allowed to read this company.'); }",
              "if (code === 404) { console.log('404 - no company with id ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('companyId') + '.'); }",
              "if (code === 405) { console.log('405 - no GET on this endpoint. Skip to request 2, but note that'); }",
              "if (code === 405) { console.log('      nothing will capture the original name, so restoring is manual.'); }",
              "",
              "let name = null;",
              "if (code === 200) {",
              "    let body = {};",
              "    try { body = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { body = {}; }",
              "    const candidates = [body, body.company, body.data, (body.items || [])[0]];",
              "    for (const c of candidates) {",
              "        if (c && c.Name) { name = c.Name; break; }",
              "        if (c && c.name) { name = c.name; break; }",
              "    }",
              "}",
              "",
              "if (name) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('originalName', name);",
              "    console.log('Current name: ' + JSON.stringify(name));",
              "    console.log('Stored in {{originalName}} - request 3 restores it.');",
              "} else if (code === 200) {",
              "    console.log('Read OK but no Name field found. Check the body; restoring will be manual.');",
              "}",
              "",
              "pm.test('Company found', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Rename company (WRITES LIVE DATA)",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "SystemInformation",
            "value": "{{systemInformation}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "username",
            "value": "{{abillityUserName}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "password",
            "value": "{{abillityPassword}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.abillity.co.uk/api/company/{{companyId}}"
        },
        "description": "The exact call the Worker makes when an Autotask company is renamed.\n\n*** THIS CHANGES LIVE BILLING DATA. ***\n\nRun request 1 first so the original name is captured, then request 3 to put it back.\n\naBILLity caps the name at 50 characters and the Worker truncates to match - keep {{testName}} under 50 unless you are deliberately testing that.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"Name\": \"{{testName}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const ok = pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300;",
              "",
              "if (ok) {",
              "    console.log('Rename accepted - this is what the Worker does.');",
              "    console.log('Run request 3 to restore ' + JSON.stringify(pm.collectionVariables.get('originalName')));",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('Rename failed with ' + pm.response.code + '.');",
              "    console.log('The Worker would log this and return \"sync failed\".');",
              "}",
              "",
              "pm.test('Rename accepted', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'expected 2xx').to.be.within(200, 299);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Restore original name",
      "request": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "SystemInformation",
            "value": "{{systemInformation}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "username",
            "value": "{{abillityUserName}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "password",
            "value": "{{abillityPassword}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "https://api.abillity.co.uk/api/company/{{companyId}}"
        },
        "description": "Puts the name back to whatever request 1 captured in {{originalName}}.\n\nIf {{originalName}} is empty, request 1 did not capture it - set the name by hand in aBILLity instead of running this.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"Name\": \"{{originalName}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const original = pm.collectionVariables.get('originalName');",
              "",
              "if (!original) {",
              "    console.log('WARNING: {{originalName}} is empty - this request just sent a blank name.');",
              "    console.log('Fix the company name by hand in aBILLity.');",
              "}",
              "",
              "if (pm.response.code >= 200 && pm.response.code < 300) {",
              "    console.log('Restored to ' + JSON.stringify(original));",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('RESTORE FAILED (' + pm.response.code + '). The company is still renamed.');",
              "    console.log('Put it back by hand in aBILLity.');",
              "}",
              "",
              "pm.test('Restored', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'expected 2xx').to.be.within(200, 299);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "systemInformation",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "abillityUserName",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "abillityPassword",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "companyId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "testName",
      "value": "Test Rename - safe to ignore",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "originalName",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
